@title Part picker: a symbol thumbnail beside parts whose kind is clear
@area Parts
# Lane V5 follow-up. Select devices (Ctrl+A), open "Choose a part for all" in
# the selection sheet: each part with a clear kind (contactor, fuse, lamp...)
# shows its symbol as a small picture; others show none rather than a guess.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+a
wait 8
click_text "Choose a part for all"
wait 8
shot picker
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
